    <item>
      <title>当特朗普暂停电子税时，美元目前就找到了支持</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在美国对受欢迎的消费电子产品暂停关税之后，美元降低了最近的骚扰，尽管唐纳德·特朗普总统限制了对技术领域的豁免，但恢复的限制。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 21:09:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>布鲁克菲尔德在中东有数十亿美元的私募股权复兴</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2025-04-13/dubai-brookfield-has-billions-riding-on-middle-east-private-equity-revival</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于特朗普的关税所激发的市场动荡，该地区更具吸引力]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2025-04-13/dubai-brookfield-has-billions-riding-on-middle-east-private-equity-revival</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 21:00:31 GMT</pubDate>
